{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","尼汝"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名能够使用秘咒的辅助，能够让友军以灵魂形态继续作战。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一起来收割吧……"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's go harvest together."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","多么迷人啊，这就是灵魂的味道"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Fascinating... This is what a soul tastes like."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","听我的，你还不能离开"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Listen, you still cannot leave yet."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","结束了……这次是真的"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Finished... for real... this time..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","又增加了全新的收藏品"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Ah...Another new soul for the taking."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我是个有品味的收藏家，藏品是……灵魂"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","有点暗吗？放心吧，灵魂烧起来绝对够亮。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","看看我的宝贝收藏，爱情藏在哪儿呢？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","研究需要付出很多，你我都是耗材，哈哈哈哈。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噢……我闻到了，灵魂的味道……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是你的藏品？有趣……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","实验之余的放松头脑……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","回去做实验吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","比灵魂更纯净的味道……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪让身体变得更冷"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","做冰雕吗？我有材料"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","尽情欢乐吧，呵呵呵……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯光只会让夜晚更黑暗"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","尼汝有一本小册子，记录了他军医生涯中没能救活的人数。目前这个数字停留在530。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","比起配制药剂，尼汝更擅长进行手术。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","尼汝的镰刀太大，挥起来很费力。他常试图用魔法减轻镰刀的重量。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“他不是一个称职的丈夫和父亲，但我还是……”雪米拉曾说。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“以前，爸爸回家的时候，总是会带我去没去过的地方玩。”戴蒙曾说。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据某法庭书记官记载，军医尼汝因杀害伤兵而被起诉，在庭上，他一句话都没有辩驳，反而露出笑容。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据尼汝过去的战友说，他是一个很少和伤者说话的医生。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","据说，曾有伤兵主动要求尼汝结束自己的生命。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","尼汝身上至今还带着行军时戴蒙从家里寄来的信。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","据说，尼汝曾被自己救活的伤者咒骂，但因为那人面部损伤严重，尼汝没能听懂他说的话。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","哦，维珀里安，最近实验顺利吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415019.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","尼汝 & 维珀里安"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","实验之余的放松头脑……"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415134.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","比灵魂更纯净的味道……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415135.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","雪让身体变得更冷"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415449.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","做冰雕吗？我有材料"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415450.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","尽情欢乐吧，呵呵呵……"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415627.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","灯光只会让夜晚更黑暗"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415628.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","尼汝"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","啊，一位战场幸存者，有着无比坚韧的灵魂。"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415804.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","尼汝 & 瑟恩（未完整）"]]}